WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.092
Read widely for pleasure and information. Explain plot, characters, key details and

00:00:05.092 --> 00:00:07.539
personal response in your own words.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:13.052
What comes first when preparing a summary? Answer: Read the whole text for its

00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:13.721
central idea.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:19.113
Read a book independently, write a brief thoughtful review and recommend it to a

00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:19.440
classmate.

00:00:20.283 --> 00:00:22.523
Why it works: The gist guides selection.
